<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58060" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλωγμός</span></b>  (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλωσμός</span></b> , v. infr.), ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλώζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clucking</i> of hens, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.129a
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλωσμοῖς</span> codd.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>clucking sound</i> by which we urge on a horse, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				9.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.209
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>clucking sound</i> by which Greek audiences expressed
			disapprobation, <i>hooting</i>, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>JTr.</u>
				31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1504.29
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλωσμός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.599
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλωγμός</span>
			), Harp.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκλώζετε</span>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
